define flow character break detection
  """
  HydraPoT addition. Flags a prompt that probes the system's identity
  ("are you an AI?") rather than running a command.

  It does NOT refuse. NeMo's shipped jailbreak flows end in `bot refuse to
  respond`, which tells an attacker they hit a filter -- the one outcome a
  honeypot must avoid. The verdict is recorded and the turn continues; the
  caller decides what to do with it (HydraPoT re-routes to Cowrie).
  """
  $result = execute CharacterBreakDetectionAction
  $is_character_break = $result.is_blocked
